<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:13:42 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>十年前方程式学生赛车</title><link>https://some.pics/6b07c0002385b</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;大学生方程式赛车 - 10年前。通过&lt;a href="https://flohgro.com/onthisday/"&gt;On This Day&lt;/a&gt;找到。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A blue formula student race car with the number 60 rests on a path beside a lake, reflected in the water below." height="2560" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/flohgro/6b07c0002385b.jpg" width="3840"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://flohgro.some.pics"&gt;@flohgro&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:13:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>发现趣味小径</title><link>https://some.pics/6b07a30e2dd71</link><description>&lt;p&gt;今天我发现了一条非常有趣的步道，之后看地图时我觉得自己可能错过了一条小路，或者是有棵倒下的树和灌木把它遮住了，我肯定会再找机会回到这里。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A wooden boardwalk bridges a path covered in fallen leaves through a forest." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/ericmwalk/6b07a30e2dd71.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://ericmwalk.some.pics"&gt;@ericmwalk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 03:10:14 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>雪莱致月：疲倦的月亮</title><link>https://some.pics/6b07a0f54ac82</link><description>&lt;p&gt;“你可是因疲倦而苍白
因攀登天堂、凝视大地？”
——珀西·比希·雪莱，《致月亮》

致双子座中的月亮，亏凸月，太阳在射手座。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Portrait botanical watercolor with lavender clematis vines framing a Shelley quotation on pale peach, maidenhair ferns and silvery seedheads below, and a gold emblem at bottom-right. Text: Art thou pale for weariness Of climbing heaven and gazing on the earth? — Percy Bysshe Shelley, To the Moon Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1440" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6b07a0f54ac82.jpg" width="1080"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 03:01:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>晴朗的一天</title><link>https://some.pics/6b07902eb3ae9</link><description>&lt;p&gt;今天天气晴朗。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Snow-dusted mountains under a clear blue sky, framed by green and red trees." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6b07902eb3ae9.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:49:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>今日精油：甜杏仁油</title><link>https://some.pics/6b07687955154</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;今日精油 — 甜杏仁油&lt;/strong&gt;（2026-11-25）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://mizj.me/p8a167dd7"&gt;进入商店 →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Today's Oil: Sweet Almond Oil (Prunus amygdalus Batsch). Watercolor botanical plate with correspondences: Known for Prosperity, wisdom, divination and attraction.; Element Air; Planet Mercury, Jupiter; Energy Masculine; Zodiac Gemini, Virgo and Aquarius in modern magical herbalism; Deities Attis, Mercury, Thoth and Hermes in modern magical herbalism." height="1440" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6b07687955154.jpg" width="1080"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:00:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>精灵族起源前传</title><link>https://some.pics/6b0754b61b991</link><description>&lt;p&gt;第一，最重要的是，永远不要与人类繁衍后代。
第二，保护人类。
第三，不惜一切代价保护并关爱彼此。

在帷幕降临之前……
在历史被抹去之前……
在命运开始之前……

西尔塔瑞尔的仙灵之境繁荣昌盛。

西尔塔瑞尔（sheel-ha-ree-el）是卡洛布·丹尼尔（Kalob Dàniel）的LGBTQ+新成人仙灵双部曲的前传中篇小说，记载了仙灵种族的诞生、他们的元素宫廷，以及塑造了艾尔萨姆赫（air-ha-weh）大地的远古时代。

故事跨越一千五百余年，追溯了仙灵魔法的脆弱平衡以及仙灵与人类之间微妙的共存……直到帷幕降临，将西尔塔瑞尔和艾尔（air-uh）一同推入一个持续近两千年之久的黑暗时代。

始于庆典，终于沉寂。

这是关于仙灵种族的兴衰、被封印之物，以及终有一日必须在《命运之 nexus》和《宫廷之 syzygy》的事件中再度觉醒之物的故事。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="One, above all, never procreate with humans.
Two, protect humankind.
Three, protect and care for each other no matter the cost.

Before the Veil fell…
Before history was erased…
Before destiny began…

The Faerie Realm of Síltharíel thrived.

Síltharíel (sheel-ha-ree-el) is a prequel novella to Kalob Dàniel’s LGBTQ+ new adult A Faerie Tale duology, chronicling the creation of the faerie race, their elemental courts, and the ancient age that shaped the lands of Éirthamhe (air-ha-weh).

Spanning over fifteen centuries, the story traces the fragile balance of faerie magic and the tenuous coexistence of faerie and human…until the Veil descends, ushering Síltharíel and Éire (air-uh) alike into a Dark Age that will last nearly two millennia.

What begins in celebration ends in silence.

This is the story of the rise and fall of faeriekind, what was sealed away, and what must one day awaken again within the events of The Nexus of Destiny and The Syzygy of Courts." height="1920" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/kalobdaniel/6b0754b61b991.jpg" width="1341"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://kalobdaniel.some.pics"&gt;@kalobdaniel&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:35:53 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>PS5未到，GTA6还得等</title><link>https://some.pics/6b074b60beb89</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我这儿还没弄到PS5，所以GTA 6还得再等等哈哈&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="a ps vita with the gta vice city loading screen" height="1280" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6b074b60beb89.jpg" width="1280"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:56:03 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>2026年11月24日关键角色</title><link>https://some.pics/6b0741f48da7a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2026年11月24日的关键角色。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Boards of Canada - Music Is Math" height="1080" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dechado/6b0741f48da7a.png" width="1080"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dechado.some.pics"&gt;@dechado&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:15:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>专注学习草本精油配方</title><link>https://some.pics/6b0730b074500</link><description>&lt;p&gt;专注与学习草本精油配方
https://mizjeannie.com/formulary/herb-and-oil-blend-for-focus-and-study&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Herb and Oil Blend for Focus and Study. Ingredients: 2 teaspoons Astragalus Root, cut and dried; 2 teaspoons Horehound, cut and dried; 2 drops Rosemary Essential Oil, with watercolor-and-ink illustrations of yellow-flowered astragalus with exposed roots, white-flowered horehound, and purple-flowered rosemary on a pale peach card." height="1440" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6b0730b074500.jpg" width="1080"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:02:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>暮光渐逝</title><link>https://some.pics/6b071cc7566ca</link><description>&lt;p&gt;渐暗的光线&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="The picture shows a dark foreground created by curtains that are almost completely drawn, with two triangular vertical gaps offering a view of the sky, the colour of which transitions from deep blue at the top to light blue and a warm yellow-orange at the horizon." height="2843" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6b071cc7566ca.jpg" width="2654"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:37:14 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>